  "question": {
    "text": "A train moves towards a stationary observer with speed&nbsp;<math><mn>34&nbsp;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The train sounds a whistle and its frequency registered by the observer is <math><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math>. If the train's speed is reduced to <math><mn>17&nbsp;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, the frequency registered is <math><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>. If the speed of sound is <math><mn>340&nbsp;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, then the ratio&nbsp; <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mi>f</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mi>f</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
